{
 "uid": "spieli-federation",
 "title": "spieli federation",
 "schemaVersion": 39,
 "time": {
  "from": "now-6h",
  "to": "now"
 },
 "refresh": "1m",
 "panels": [
  {
   "id": 14,
   "type": "text",
   "title": "About this dashboard",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 8
   },
   "description": "What the data is and how mapping detail is defined. Every other panel refers here.",
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "**Source.** Everything here comes from one spieli hub's `/metrics`, written by `oci/app/poll-federation.sh`. The hub probes each backend's `get_meta` every 60 s from its own server (3 s timeout); Prometheus scrapes the hub every 60 s. A backend is one regional data node listed in the hub's `registry.json`.\n\n**Mapping detail** says how much of a playground is mapped in OpenStreetMap, not how good it is:\n\n- **Detailed** (`complete`): play equipment (any `playground=*` object, or a soccer/basketball/table-tennis pitch) **and** info (`opening_hours`, `surface` or a meaningful `access`).\n- **Basic** (`partial`): one of the two.\n- **No details yet** (`missing`): neither.\n\nBenches, shelters, picnic tables and photos do not count. The rule lives in `app/src/lib/completeness.js` (mirrored in `importer/api.sql`); see `docs/reference/completeness.md`.\n\nHover the ⓘ next to a panel title for what it shows and what an unusual value means."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "title": "Backends up",
   "type": "stat",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prom"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 8,
    "w": 6,
    "h": 4
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prom"
     },
     "expr": "sum(spielplatz_backend_up{job=\"spieli_hub\"})",
     "legendFormat": ""
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "color": {
      "mode": "fixed",
      "fixedColor": "text"
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "description": "Number of backends (regional data nodes) that answered the hub's last `get_meta` probe within 3 s.\n\n**Means:** should equal the number of backends in `registry.json`. Lower = some region's map is currently missing from the hub.\n\nData source and the mapping-detail rule: see *About this dashboard* at the top."
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "title": "Backends down",
   "type": "stat",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prom"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 6,
    "y": 8,
    "w": 6,
    "h": 4
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prom"
     },
     "expr": "count(spielplatz_backend_up{job=\"spieli_hub\"} == 0) or vector(0)",
     "legendFormat": ""
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "green",
        "value": null
       },
       {
        "color": "red",
        "value": 1
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "description": "Number of backends whose last probe failed (timeout after 3 s, HTTP error, or unreachable).\n\n**Means:** anything above 0 means visitors on the hub see that region as offline (dashed ring, no playgrounds).\n\nData source and the mapping-detail rule: see *About this dashboard* at the top."
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "title": "Playgrounds (all backends)",
   "type": "stat",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prom"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 12,
    "y": 8,
    "w": 6,
    "h": 4
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prom"
     },
     "expr": "sum(spielplatz_backend_playgrounds_total{job=\"spieli_hub\"})",
     "legendFormat": ""
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "color": {
      "mode": "fixed",
      "fixedColor": "text"
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "description": "Sum of all playgrounds across every backend, as reported by each backend's `get_meta`.\n\n**Means:** overall size of the federated map. A sudden drop usually means a backend is down or mid-import, not that playgrounds disappeared.\n\nData source and the mapping-detail rule: see *About this dashboard* at the top."
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "title": "Hub poll age",
   "type": "stat",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prom"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 18,
    "y": 8,
    "w": 6,
    "h": 4
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prom"
     },
     "expr": "time() - spielplatz_poll_generated_timestamp{job=\"spieli_hub\"}",
     "legendFormat": "{{job}}"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "s",
     "color": {
      "mode": "fixed",
      "fixedColor": "text"
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "description": "Seconds since each hub last wrote its `/metrics` file (`time() - spielplatz_poll_generated_timestamp`).\n\n**Means:** for the production hub this should stay below ~120 s. Much higher = the hub's poll cron has died and every other panel shows frozen data.\n\nOn a standalone stack this grows forever: it only writes a placeholder once at startup.\n\nData source and the mapping-detail rule: see *About this dashboard* at the top."
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "title": "Up per backend",
   "type": "state-timeline",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prom"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 12,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 8
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prom"
     },
     "expr": "spielplatz_backend_up{job=\"spieli_hub\"}",
     "legendFormat": "{{backend}}"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "mappings": [
      {
       "type": "value",
       "options": {
        "0": {
         "text": "down",
         "color": "red",
         "index": 0
        },
        "1": {
         "text": "up",
         "color": "green",
         "index": 1
        }
       }
      }
     ],
     "color": {
      "mode": "thresholds"
     },
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "red",
        "value": null
       },
       {
        "color": "green",
        "value": 1
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "description": "Per backend over time: up (1) or down (0) for each poll.\n\n**Means:** red stretches (down) show outages and when they happened. Short single blips are usually a slow response over the 3 s timeout.\n\nData source and the mapping-detail rule: see *About this dashboard* at the top.",
   "options": {
    "showValue": "never",
    "mergeValues": true,
    "rowHeight": 0.9,
    "legend": {
     "showLegend": false
    },
    "tooltip": {
     "mode": "single"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 6,
   "title": "get_meta latency",
   "type": "timeseries",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prom"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 20,
    "w": 8,
    "h": 8
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prom"
     },
     "expr": "spielplatz_backend_latency_seconds{job=\"spieli_hub\"} and on(backend) (spielplatz_backend_up{job=\"spieli_hub\"} == 1)",
     "legendFormat": "{{backend}}"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "s"
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "description": "Round-trip time of the hub's last `get_meta` call to each backend, measured from the hub server (not from visitors' browsers).\n\n**Means:** a rough health/load signal per backend. Rising latency often precedes timeouts; spikes are typical while a backend imports. Failed probes are left out (the exporter reports them as 0 s) — see *Up per backend* for those.\n\nData source and the mapping-detail rule: see *About this dashboard* at the top."
  },
  {
   "id": 7,
   "title": "Import age",
   "type": "timeseries",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prom"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 8,
    "y": 20,
    "w": 8,
    "h": 8
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prom"
     },
     "expr": "spielplatz_backend_data_age_seconds{job=\"spieli_hub\"}",
     "legendFormat": "{{backend}}"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "s"
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "description": "Seconds since each backend last finished an OSM data import (`last_import_at`).\n\n**Means:** how stale a region's playground data is compared to OpenStreetMap. With the importer in daemon mode (`REIMPORT_INTERVAL_MIN_DAYS` and `_MAX_DAYS` both set) the line saws up to about the max interval plus up to `REIMPORT_JITTER_HOURS` (default 6 h) and drops back; clearly beyond that, the daemon is stuck. Without daemon mode the importer runs once and exits, so the age only grows until someone re-imports — expected there. Missing line = backend down or never imported.\n\nData source and the mapping-detail rule: see *About this dashboard* at the top."
  },
  {
   "id": 8,
   "title": "Detailed share (complete / total)",
   "type": "bargauge",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prom"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 28,
    "w": 12,
    "h": 10
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prom"
     },
     "expr": "spielplatz_backend_playgrounds_complete{job=\"spieli_hub\"} / on(backend) (spielplatz_backend_playgrounds_total{job=\"spieli_hub\"} > 0)",
     "legendFormat": "{{backend}}"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "percentunit",
     "min": 0,
     "max": 1,
     "color": {
      "mode": "fixed",
      "fixedColor": "#4ade80"
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "description": "Share of each backend's playgrounds that are **detailed** (complete ÷ total; backends with 0 playgrounds are left out).\n\n**Means:** how well a region is mapped. Low values show where mappers could help.\n\nData source and the mapping-detail rule: see *About this dashboard* at the top.",
   "options": {
    "orientation": "horizontal",
    "displayMode": "basic",
    "showUnfilled": true,
    "reduceOptions": {
     "calcs": [
      "lastNotNull"
     ]
    },
    "valueMode": "color"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 9,
   "title": "Importing",
   "type": "state-timeline",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prom"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 12,
    "y": 28,
    "w": 12,
    "h": 10
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prom"
     },
     "expr": "spielplatz_backend_importing{job=\"spieli_hub\"}",
     "legendFormat": "{{backend}}"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "mappings": [
      {
       "type": "value",
       "options": {
        "0": {
         "text": "idle",
         "color": "transparent",
         "index": 0
        },
        "1": {
         "text": "importing",
         "color": "blue",
         "index": 1
        }
       }
      }
     ],
     "color": {
      "mode": "thresholds"
     },
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "transparent",
        "value": null
       },
       {
        "color": "blue",
        "value": 1
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "description": "Per backend over time: *importing* (blue) while osm2pgsql runs on that backend, otherwise idle.\n\n**Means:** during an import counts and latency may jump and the hub shows the region as updating — explains dips in other panels. How often it happens depends on each backend's `REIMPORT_INTERVAL_*` setting (none = only manual imports).\n\nData source and the mapping-detail rule: see *About this dashboard* at the top.",
   "options": {
    "showValue": "never",
    "mergeValues": true,
    "rowHeight": 0.9,
    "legend": {
     "showLegend": false
    },
    "tooltip": {
     "mode": "single"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 10,
   "type": "barchart",
   "title": "Playgrounds per backend by mapping detail",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prom"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 38,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 16
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prom"
     },
     "expr": "sum by (backend) (spielplatz_backend_playgrounds_total{job=\"spieli_hub\"})",
     "instant": true,
     "range": false,
     "format": "table"
    },
    {
     "refId": "B",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prom"
     },
     "expr": "sum by (backend) (spielplatz_backend_playgrounds_complete{job=\"spieli_hub\"})",
     "instant": true,
     "range": false,
     "format": "table"
    },
    {
     "refId": "C",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prom"
     },
     "expr": "sum by (backend) (spielplatz_backend_playgrounds_partial{job=\"spieli_hub\"})",
     "instant": true,
     "range": false,
     "format": "table"
    },
    {
     "refId": "D",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prom"
     },
     "expr": "sum by (backend) (spielplatz_backend_playgrounds_missing{job=\"spieli_hub\"})",
     "instant": true,
     "range": false,
     "format": "table"
    }
   ],
   "transformations": [
    {
     "id": "merge",
     "options": {}
    },
    {
     "id": "organize",
     "options": {
      "excludeByName": {
       "Time": true,
       "job": true,
       "url": true,
       "instance": true,
       "__name__": true
      },
      "renameByName": {
       "Value #A": "Total",
       "Value #B": "Detailed",
       "Value #C": "Basic",
       "Value #D": "No details yet"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "sortBy",
     "options": {
      "sort": [
       {
        "field": "Total",
        "desc": true
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "organize",
     "options": {
      "excludeByName": {
       "Total": true
      }
     }
    }
   ],
   "options": {
    "xField": "backend",
    "orientation": "horizontal",
    "stacking": "normal",
    "showValue": "never",
    "barWidth": 0.8,
    "groupWidth": 0.7,
    "legend": {
     "showLegend": true,
     "displayMode": "list",
     "placement": "bottom"
    },
    "tooltip": {
     "mode": "multi",
     "sort": "none"
    }
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "custom": {
      "fillOpacity": 90,
      "lineWidth": 1
     }
    },
    "overrides": [
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "Detailed"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "color",
        "value": {
         "mode": "fixed",
         "fixedColor": "#4ade80"
        }
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "Basic"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "color",
        "value": {
         "mode": "fixed",
         "fixedColor": "#15803d"
        }
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "No details yet"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "color",
        "value": {
         "mode": "fixed",
         "fixedColor": "#475569"
        }
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   "description": "Each backend's playgrounds split into **detailed / basic / no details yet**, stacked, sorted by total.\n\n**Means:** bar length = region size; green share = how well it is mapped. Compare regions at a glance; hover for exact numbers.\n\nData source and the mapping-detail rule: see *About this dashboard* at the top."
  },
